ng Valora QR Codes\n\n[![RERA QR code - PR1180002600544](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/RERA-QR-images/rera_qr_code_1781700123943-989959751.webp)\n\nPR1180002600544](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/63102)\n\n## Project approved by\n\n## About Narang Realty\n\nNarang Realty\n\n![Narang Realty](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/narang-realty_1740575418186-766174902.webp)\n\n3 CitiesLocations\n\nMumbai CityMumbai suburbanThane\n\n38 yearsExperience\n\n10Total Projects\n\n3K+Happy Families\n\nEstablished in 1988, Narang Realty is a leading real estate developer with a proven track record of delivering high-quality residential and commercial projects across the Mumbai Metropolitan Region. With a portfolio of more than 10 landmark developments spanning approximately 7.1 million square feet and having successfully delivered homes to over3,550 families, the organization is recognized for its scale, reliability and consistency of execution.\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\nYes, a sample flat is available for viewing. Currently, the 3BHK show flat is ready and can be visited. Book a free site visit through Housiey and our team will arrange everything.\n\nThe expected possession date is **01 December 2030** as per RERA. Construction is currently **10%** complete as of July 24, 2026. Target possession is **01 December 2029**.\n\nYes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is **PR1180002600544**.  \nYou can verify it on the official RERA portal: <https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/63102>\n\nYes, litigation details are disclosed as per RERA:  \n• High Court of Bombay - Other - Ongoing  \n  \nReview all documents carefully before booking.\n\nThe following legal documents are available on Housiey: **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**, **Proforma Sale Agreement**. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number **PR1180002600544**.\n\nThis project offers **20+** amenities. Key external amenities include Gymnasium, Indoor games, Creche Play Area, Seating Area, and Banquet Hall.  \n Internal specifications include Modular Kitchen and CCTV Camera. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Narang Valora, the 3BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **1360 sq. ft.**  \n• **1411 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Narang Valora, the 4BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **2109 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Narang Valora, the 5BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **2737 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Narang Valora, the 5.5BHK Duplex units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **4218 sq. ft.**  \n• **5644 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Narang Valora starts from **₹5.97 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **1360 sq. ft.** – ₹5.97 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **1411 sq. ft.** – ₹6.45 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 4BHK in Narang Valora starts from **₹10.15 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **2109 sq. ft.** – ₹10.15 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 5BHK in Narang Valora starts from **₹11.94 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **2737 sq. ft.** – ₹11.94 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 5.5BHK Duplex in Narang Valora starts from **₹20.30 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **4218 sq. ft.** – ₹20.30 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **5644 sq. ft.** – ₹27.09 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **2.78 acres** with **2** towers with **2B+7P+G+35** floors. Each floor has **7** flats per floor, **7** lifts, **2** staircases. It is available in **3BHK/4BHK/5BHK/5.5BHK Duplex** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **1360** to **5644 sq. ft.**\n\nNarang Valora provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Narang Valora project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **Near New Link Rd, Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• DMart - 600m**   \n**• Inorbit Mall - 850m**   \n**• SV Road - 1.9km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹89.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **Narang Realty**, a trusted real estate brand with over **38 years** of experience and more than **10 completed projects** across **Mumbai City, Mumbai suburban and Thane**.  \n**Some of their notable developments include:**  \n  \n • **Narang Privado** in Vartak Nagar Thane, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Narang Vivenda** in Malad West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Asteria by Court yard** in Pokhran Road Thane, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Narang Bangur Nagar** in Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\nThe Commencement Certificate is available. The **Occupancy Certificate (OC)** will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Goregaon West** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **Narang Realty** - with 38 years of experience - offers 3BHK/4BHK/5BHK/5.5BHK Duplex at ₹5.97 Cr to ₹27.09 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying through Housiey gives you:  \n(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price  \n(2) Free Ola cab site visit  \n(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home  \n(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal  \n(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project  \nAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\n\nThe price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \"Price Sheet\" or \"Brochure\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\n\nHousiey has a **4.8 rating** on Google with **2,395+ reviews**.  \n  \nOver **8,500 families** have purchased homes through Housiey across **8+ cities** with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted **1.2 lakh+ free site visits** and facilitated over **₹8,000 crore** worth of property transactions.\n\n## Explore Related Projects\n\n![Laxmi Shrushti](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Laxmi_Shrushti_Elevation_--1697108240451-img-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Laxmi Shrushti](/projects/laxmi-shrushti)\n\n₹ 1.70 Cr (All inc)\n\n[The Laxmi Group](/builder/the-laxmi-group)\n\n435- 700sqft