33 Cr\n\n3BHKLimited\n\n₹3.31 Cr\n\n2.5BHKSold Out\n\n-\n\n3BHKSold Out\n\n-\n\n[Gundecha Group](/builder/gundecha-group)Developer\n\n![Legal Illustration](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Fsquare-dots.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![Legal Illustration](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2FlegalSection.webp&w=1024&q=75)\n\nHousiey Legal: Free Real Estate Legal Consultation\n\nGet Expert Advice on RERA, Builder Refunds, Area Mismatch, Stuck Projects & More - at No Cost!\n\n100% Free","images":[]},{"url":"https://propertycloud.in/properties/explore/narang-valora","title":"Narang Valora | Book 3,4 & 5 BHK With Flexible Pay - Propertycloud.in","raw_content":"* [![Narang Valora](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/gallery/1784613559.png)](https://propertycloud.in/ \"Narang Valora\")\n* [![Narang Valora](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/projectimages/faviconicon.png)](https://propertycloud.in/ \"Narang-Valora\")\n* [![Narang Valora](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/projectimages/overview.png)Overview](#overview \"Narang Valora\")\n* [![Narang Valora](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/projectimages/price.png)Costing](#costing \"Narang Valora\")\n* [![Narang Valora Plan](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/projectimages/plan.png)Site & Floor Plan](#siteplans \"Narang Valora\")\n* [![Narang Valora Amenities](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/projectimages/amenities.png)Amenities](#amenities \"Narang Valora\")\n* [![Narang Valora Location](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/projectimages/location.png)Location](#location \"Narang Valora\")\n* [![Narang Valora Site Visit](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/projectimages/site-visit.png)Virtual Visit](#sitevisit \"Narang Valora\")\n\n![Narang Valora Image 1](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/gallery/1784613578.jpeg) ![Narang Valora Image 1](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/gallery/1784613578.jpeg)\n\nNew Launch\n\n# Narang Valora\n\n- Goregaon west, Mumbai  \n- Narang Valora\n\n* ▸ Easy Connectivity\n* ▸ World Class Amenities\n* ▸ Flexible Payment Plan\n* ▸ Vastu Flats\n* ▸ 2 Towers\n\n  G+40 Storeys  Ultra Luxury Apartments     Possession In Dec 2029 \n\n- Smart design for sunlight & ventilation\n\n- Starting Price: 6.5 Cr\\*\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/projectimages/pdf.png)\n\n#### Pre-Register here for Best Offers\n\nOverview\n\nNarang Valora\n\n## **Project Overview – Narang Valora**\n\nNarang Valora is a premium residential development located in the heart of **Goregaon West, Mumbai**, offering thoughtfully designed homes that combine modern architecture, luxury, and convenience. Developed by **Narang Realty**, the project features spacious 3**, 4, and 5 BHK apartments** crafted with contemporary layouts, premium specifications, and elegant interiors. Designed to meet the lifestyle aspirations of modern families, Narang Valora provides an exceptional living experience in one of Mumbai's most well-connected residential neighbourhoods.  Explore more [**Properties in Mumbai**](https://propertycloud.in/properties/locations/) and discover other [**New Projects in Mumbai**](https://propertycloud.in/properties/location/Mumbai/).\n\nThe residences are intelligently planned to maximize natural light, cross ventilation, and functional living spaces. Every apartment features spacious living and dining areas, stylish kitchens, premium fittings, well-designed bedrooms, and expansive balconies that offer a comfortable and sophisticated lifestyle. High-quality construction and attention to detail ensure a perfect blend of aesthetics and practicality.\n\nNarang Valora offers a comprehensive range of lifestyle amenities designed for relaxation, recreation, and wellness. Residents can enjoy a grand clubhouse, swimming pool, fully equipped gymnasium, landscaped gardens, children's play area, jogging track, indoor games room, multipurpose hall, yoga deck, sports facilities, senior citizen seating areas, and beautifully planned open spaces. The project also provides 24×7 security, CCTV surveillance, power backup, high-speed elevators, and ample parking for a safe and convenient living environment.\n\nOne of the key highlights of Narang Valora is its strategic location in **Goregaon West**, providing excellent connectivity to **Link Road**, **SV Road**, **Western Express Highway**, **Goregaon Railway Station**, and **Oshiwara Metro Station**. Residents can easily access major business hubs such as **NESCO IT Park**, **Mindspace Malad**, **BKC**, **Andheri**, and **Powai**, making it an ideal address for working professionals.\n\nThe neighbourhood is surrounded by premium social infrastructure, including reputed schools, colleges, hospitals, shopping malls, supermarkets, restaurants, and entertainment centres. Popular destinations such as **Inorbit Mall**, **Infinity Mall**, **Oberoi Mall**, and **Lokhandwala** are located nearby, ensuring residents enjoy a vibrant and convenient lifestyle with every essential facility within easy reach.\n\nGoregaon West has emerged as one of Mumbai's fastest-growing residential destinations due to continuous infrastructure development, metro connectivity, and proximity to major commercial hubs. Strong demand for premium residences, excellent civic infrastructure, and high rental potential make the area an attractive destination for both homebuyers and investors seeking long-term value appreciation.\n\n**Narang Valora Amenities**\n\n* Swimming Pool\n* Gym\n* Kids Play Area\n* Yoga\n* Jogging Track\n* Cricket\n* Club House\n* Pool Table\n\n**Narang Valora Connectivity**\n\nGoregaon Railway Station – 5 Mins\n\nRam Mandir Railway Station – 7 Mins\n\nLink Road – 2 Mins\n\nWestern Express Highway – 8 Mins\n\nOshiwara Metro Station – 8 Mins\n\nNESCO IT Park – 10 Mins\n\nMalad West – 15 Mins\n\n**Narang Valora Carpet Area**\n\n3 BHK - ( 1300 - 1500 Sq.ft )\n\n4 BHK - ( 2000 - 2200 Sq.ft )\n\n5 BHK - ( 2800 - 3000 Sq.ft )\n\n**Narang Valora Possesion Date**\n\nDec 2029\n\n**Book your dream home today & get the best offer. Enquire now!**\n\n**Narang Valora – FAQs**\n\n1. Where is Narang Valora located?\n\nNarang Valora is located in **Goregaon West, Mumbai**, with excellent connectivity to Link Road, SV Road, Western Express Highway, and Goregaon Railway Station.\n\n2. What configurations are available at Narang Valora?\n\nThe project offers premium 3**, 4, and 5 BHK apartments** with spacious layouts and modern specifications.\n\n3. Who is the developer of Narang Valora?\n\nNarang Valora is developed by **Narang Realty**, a reputed real estate developer known for delivering premium residential projects.\n\n4. What amenities are available at Narang Valora?\n\nThe project offers a clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, landscaped gardens, children's play area, jogging track, indoor games, sports facilities, and 24×7 security.\n\n5. Is Narang Valora RERA registered?\n\nYes, Narang Valora is a **MahaRERA-registered** project. Buyers should verify the latest RERA registration details before booking.\n\n6. Is Narang Valora well connected?\n\nYes, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to **Link Road, Western Express Highway, Goregaon Railway Station, Oshiwara Metro Station, NESCO IT Park, and Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport**.\n\n7. Are schools, hospitals, and shopping malls nearby?\n\nYes, reputed schools, hospitals, supermarkets, and shopping destinations such as **Inorbit Mall, Oberoi Mall, and Infinity Mall** are located within a short distance of the project.\n\n8. Is Narang Valora a good investment?\n\nYes, its prime location in **Goregaon West**, premium amenities, strong connectivity, and high appreciation potential make it an excellent investment opportunity for both homebuyers and investors.\n\n \n\n---\n\n  \n  \n\nPrice Pricing\n\n| Type | Carpet Area | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Investing In The Best Location |\n| 3 BHK | 1300 - 1500 Sq.ft | ₹ On Request |\n| 4 BHK | 2000 - 2200 Sq.ft | ₹ On Request |\n| 5 BHK | 2800 - 3000 Sq.ft | ₹ On Request |\n\n---\n\n##### Payment Plan  Narang Valora Download\n\n![Avatar](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/projectimages/costing-details.jpg)\n\n  \n\n##### Download CostSheet  Narang Valora Download\n\n  \n  \n\nFloor Plans   \nSite & Floor Plan\n\n![Avatar](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/floorplan/1784615212.png)\n\n##### 3 BHK\n\n![Avatar](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/floorplan/1784615255.png)\n\n##### 4 BHK\n\n![Avatar](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/floorplan/1784615315.png)\n\n##### 5 BHK\n\n  \n  \n\nAmenities Amenities\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/amenity/1744871926.png) Meditation Pod\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/amenity/1716529410.png) Clubhouse\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/amenity/1716529066.png) Badminton Court\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/amenity/1652695990.png) Swimming Pool\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/amenity/cctv.png) CCTV Security\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/amenity/1652695953.png) Cricket\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/amenity/kids-play-area.png) kids play area\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/amenity/gym.png) gym\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/amenity/1652694591.png) Tennis Court\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/amenity/jogging.png) jogging\n\n  \n  \n\nGallery   \nGallery\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/gallery/1784613766.png)\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/gallery/1784614185.jpg)\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/gallery/1784614332.webp)\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/gallery/1784614416.webp)\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/gallery/1784614683.jpg)\n\n [Previous](#customRKSlider)   [Next](#customRKSlider)\n\n  \n  \n\nLocation Location Map\n\n* [Location Map](#pills-home)\n\nNarang Valora is strategically located in Goregaon West, Mumbai, one of the city's most sought-after residential destinations. The project offers an ideal combination of premium living, excellent connectivity, and modern urban conveniences. Situated close to Link Road, SV Road, and the Western Express Highway, residents enjoy seamless access to major business districts, commercial hubs, and entertainment centres across Mumbai.The project is well connected to key locations such as Andheri, Malad, Bandra-Kurla Complex (BKC), Powai, and Lower Parel through an extensive road and metro network. Goregaon Railway Station and the Mumbai Metro Line provide convenient public transport options, while Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is easily accessible for frequent travellers. This strategic location makes Narang Valora an excellent choice for professionals working in Mumbai's major business hubs.\n\nGoregaon Railway Station – 5 Mins\n\nRam Mandir Railway Station – 7 Mins\n\nLink Road – 2 Mins\n\nWestern Express Highway – 8 Mins\n\nOshiwara Metro Station – 8 Mins\n\nNESCO IT Park – 10 Mins\n\nMindspace\n\nMalad West – 15 Mins\n\n  \n  \n\nVirtual Tour\n\nVirtual Tour\n  \n About Narang Valora\n\nTake a virtual tour of Narang Valora in Goregaon West, Mumbai, and explore a premium residential community designed for modern urban living. Experience thoughtfully planned residences, elegant interiors, landscaped gardens, a grand clubhouse, and world-class lifestyle amenities from the comfort of your home. Discover the project's excellent connectivity to Link Road, Goregaon Railway Station, Western Express Highway, Oshiwara Metro Station, NESCO IT Park, and Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport. This immersive virtual tour allows you to explore every corner of the development, helping you visualize your future home and make a confident home-buying decision.\n\n![](https://propertycloud.in/assets/images/projectimages/pdf.png)\n\nRERA No : PRM/KA/RERA/1251/446/PR/280222/004736  \n Disclaimer & Privacy Policy : The content is for information purpos