m/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/Photo_h310_w462/2026/07/10/Floor-Plan-14-Narang-Valora-Mumbai-5451311_1440_1920_310_462_470_1080.jpg \"image of Narang Valora\")\n\n# Narang Valora Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n## By Narang Realty\n\n## Narang Valora Floor Plans & Pricing\n\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK 855 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK 855 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK 869 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK 869 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK 1012 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK 1012 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK 1358 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK 1358 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK 1360 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK 1360 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK 1411 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK 1411 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![Narang Valora 2 BHK 689 undefined floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 2 BHK 689 undefined floor plan\")\n![Narang Valora 2 BHK 781 undefined floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 2 BHK 781 undefined floor plan\")\n![Narang Valora 5 BHK 2737 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 5 BHK 2737 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![Narang Valora 4 BHK 2109 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 4 BHK 2109 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"image\")\n\n## Properties in Narang Valora\n\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft\")\n\n## Properties in Narang Valora\n\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 2109 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 5 BHK Flat 2737 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft\")\n![Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat 1411 sq.ft\")\n\n## About Narang Valora Mumbai\n\n## Narang Valora Mumbai Top Amenities\n\nNarang Valora in Goregaon West, Mumbai by Narang Realty is a residential project in the price range of Rs. 5.97 Cr - 12.01 Cr. This under-construction project offers premium 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and 4 BHK apartments with configurations ranging from 689 sq ft to 2109 sq ft of super area. The RERA approved project bears the registration number PR1180002600544. The combination of varied BHK sizes, reliable RERA compliance, and strong railway connectivity makes it an extremely practical selection for real estate buyers.\n\n### Narang Valora - Key Facts\n\nNarang Valora extends across an area of 3 acres of land.\n\nThe structure features 2 towers with a total of 493 units.\n\nThe developer recorded the launch date in May 2026.\n\nHomebuyers will receive possession of Narang Valora by December 2031.\n\nThe specific postal code for the project location is 400104.\n\n### Why Buy in Narang Valora\n\nInvesting in Narang Valora connects you to a trusted brand name like Narang Realty.\n\nThe land layout leaves generous open spaces for fresh air.\n\nThe project offers extensive options for larger families with 4 BHK layouts.\n\nBuyers secure property in a highly demanded residential belt of Mumbai.\n\nThe project features proper spacing between the towers for ventilation.\n\nThe building blueprint includes dedicated structures for fire safety.\n\nYou get multi-level vehicle management options on the premises.\n\nThe units have vast windows to let in natural light.\n\nLiving in Narang Valora keeps you close to commercial workspaces.\n\nProperties in this micro-market show consistent long-term rental demand.\n\n### What People Say about Narang Valora\n\nTravel comfort is high as Ram Mandir station is very close.\n\nThe nearest metro station takes just 5 minutes to reach.\n\nMultiple dining options and restaurants operate in the immediate vicinity.\n\nS V Road hosts prominent retail brands and useful showrooms.\n\nThe Jawahar Nagar area acts as a highly favorable business location.\n\nLocal markets provide easy access to fresh daily groceries.\n\nThe presence of 24/7 security personnel reassures nuclear families.\n\nMaintenance costs might turn out a bit elevated over time.\n\nPeak traffic hours create minor driving delays on nearby link roads.\n\n### Narang Valora - Location & Connectivity\n\nRam Mandir railway station is within walking distance for daily commuting\n\nSuvidha Hospital and Polyclinic is located at a distance of 0.1 km\n\nPrarthana Hospital and ICU lies just 0.5 km away from the gates\n\nParents can access Vivek Vidyalaya within a short 0.6 km distance\n\nPooja Hospital provides medical emergency care 0.7 km away\n\nMajor electronic retail hubs like Vijay Sales is within 0.1 km\n\nShoppers can reach Bhagwati Shopping Centre at a distance of 1.7 km\n\nInOrbit Mall offers entertainment choices at a distance of 1.2 km\n\nProfessionals can commute to Mindspace Malad (which is 2.4 km away)\n\n### Amenities offered by Narang Valora\n\nReserved Parking spaces for every vehicle owner\n\nMulti-tiered sewage treatment plant for liquid waste management\n\nHigh-capacity water storage reservoirs to prevent dry spells\n\nRainwater harvesting systems to collect and conserve monsoon water\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Narang Valora Price | Rs. 5.97 Cr - 12.01 Cr |\n| Property Types | Flat |\n| Project Type | Residential |\n| Narang Valora Status | Under Construction |\n| Narang Valora Launch Date | 01 May 2026 |\n| Narang Valora Possession Date | 01 December 2031 |\n| Towers in Narang Valora | 2 |\n\n### Narang Valora Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Narang Valora 2 BHK Flat | 689 Sq. Ft. |\n| Narang Valora 2 BHK Flat | 781 Sq. Ft. |\n| Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat | 855 Sq. Ft. |\n| Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat | 869 Sq. Ft. |\n| Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat | 1012 Sq. Ft. |\n| Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat | 1358 Sq. Ft. |\n| Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat | 1360 Sq. Ft. |\n| Narang Valora 3 BHK Flat | 1411 Sq. Ft. |\n| Narang Valora 4 BHK Flat | 2109 Sq. Ft. |\n\n### How is the Goregaon West Real Estate Market?\n\n## Ratings & Reviews for Goregaon West\n\n![map image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, 