usive 3, 4, 5 BHK Homes At Goregaon West, Mumbai by Narang Realty Builder Developer   \n\n3+ Land Parcel.\n\n 40+ Lifestyle Amenities \n\nNear to JAIN Derasar\n\n Launch Benefits | Special Discount \n\nNear By Metro Station & Railway station\n\n  \n  Narang Valora   Starts From ₹ 5.96 Cr ++  \n Rera Regd. No. :\n\nPre-Register here for Best Offers\n\n[E-Brochures pdf](#)  [Master Plan](#)  [Floor Plan](#)  [Price List](#)  [Cost Sheet](#)  [Price Breakup](#)  [Schedule a site visit.](#)\n\nOverview Narang Valora  At Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\nNarang Valora Bangur Nagar Goregaon West, Mumbai. Narang Valora has a 3-acre land parcel, 42-storey residential tower with 2-level basement, ground floor, 5-level podium, and habitable floors from Levels 6 to 42.. Price, Location, Floor Plan, Brochure, Sample Flat, Project Reviews, Complaints, Information about the nearby station, possession date, payment plan, and cost sheet is available.\n\n---\n\n### Project Highlights\n\n* **Narang Valora Apartments:** Premium 3 BHK, 4 BHK & 5 BHK luxury apartments in Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai.\n* **Narang Valora Brochure:** Download the official Narang Valora brochure PDF to explore the project details, floor plans, apartment configurations, payment plan, unit plans, cost sheet, and latest price list.\n* **Narang Valora Possession Date:** As per the developer, the expected possession is December 2030, while the RERA possession timeline is 2031.\n* **Narang Valora Construction Quality:** Built using advanced Mivan Construction Technology for superior quality, durability, and faster project completion.\n* **Narang Valora Reviews:** Narang Valora has received positive reviews from homebuyers and site visitors, with an average rating of 4/5. Explore the key advantages, USPs, amenities, location benefits, and investment potential of Narang Valora in Goregaon West, Mumbai.\n* **Narang Valora Payment Plan:** The project offers a flexible Construction Linked Payment (CLP) plan, making home buying convenient for customers.\n* **Narang Valora Sales Office:** Visit the official Sales Experience Gallery at the Goregaon West project site. For bookings and inquiries, call **+91 8080808667**.\n* **Narang Valora Price Per Sq. Ft. (PSF):** Starting from approximately ₹46,000 per sq. ft. Prices are subject to change and may be negotiable.\n* **Narang Valora RERA Number:** RERA Registration No.: **Update Pending**.\n* **Narang Valora Official Website:** https://narangdevelopers.com/\n* **Narang Valora Floor Plan:** The project comprises a 42-storey residential tower featuring 2 basement levels, Ground Floor, 5 podium levels, and habitable floors from Level 6 to Level 42.\n* **Sales Office Address & Contact Details:** Narang Valora Sales Experience Gallery, Bangur Nagar, Near Goregaon West Railway Station and Bangur Nagar Metro Station, Mumbai. Contact: **+91 8080808667** | Email: **NarangGoregaonWest@developerssalesoffice.com**.\n\n  \n  \n\n### Narang Valora: Video\n\nPrice List\n\n| Type | Carpet Area | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 BHK | 1360 Sq. Ft. (Carpet Area) | 5.97 Cr.++ |  |\n| 3 BHK | 1411 Sq. Ft. (Carpet Area) |  |\n| 4 BHK | 2109 Sq. Ft. (Carpet Area) |  |\n| 5 BHK | 2737 Sq. Ft. (Carpet Area) |  |\n| Duplex Residences | 4218 - 5644 Sq. Ft. (Carpet Area) | 20.30 Cr.++ |  |\n\n[![Floor Plan, Brochure, sample flat, Project reviews, complaints, Near Station, Possession Date, Payment Plan, Cost Sheet]() \nEnquire Now\n\n##### Complete Costing Details](#)\n\nSite & Floor Plan\n\nMaster Plan [![Floor Plan, Brochure, sample flat, Project reviews, complaints, Near Station, Possession Date, Payment Plan, Cost Sheet]() \nView Master Plan](#)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n[![Floor Plan, Brochure, sample flat, Project reviews, complaints, Near Station, Possession Date, Payment Plan, Cost Sheet]() \nEnquire Now\n\n##### 3 BHK](#)\n\n[![Floor Plan, Brochure, sample flat, Project reviews, complaints, Near Station, Possession Date, Payment Plan, Cost Sheet]()